'''Cat Clan Heroes''' are an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]]. They can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]] increases health and [[Weaken|Weaken]] duration, while also gaining [[Immune to Curse|Curse Immunity]] and [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] targeting. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]] increases health and piercing range, shortens backswing and attack frequency, and grants [[Explosion]] as well as [[Immune to Waves|Wave Immunity]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 11.1 Update|Version 11.1]].

